olid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde ficam localizados o secretariado, a partida e a chegada?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A concentra\u00e7\u00e3o, as partidas e as chegadas t\u00eam lugar na pista de atletismo do Est\u00e1dio Municipal da Branca.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e os hor\u00e1rios de in\u00edcio das provas?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As provas jovens decorrem entre as 16:30 e as 17:45 (Benjamins 600 m, Infantis 1.300 m e Iniciados\/Juvenis 2.600 m), enquanto a Corrida principal de 10 km parte \u00e0s 18:00.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">A dist\u00e2ncia de 10 km \u00e9 oficial e certificada?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, o percurso principal de 10.000 metros possui dist\u00e2ncia oficialmente certificada e conta com arbitragem do Conselho de Arbitragem da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Aveiro.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os prazos e valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem online at\u00e9 20 de dezembro de 2026. Os escal\u00f5es jovens (Benjamins a Juvenis) t\u00eam inscri\u00e7\u00e3o gratuita, enquanto a prova de 10 km custa 7,00 \u20ac at\u00e9 15 de novembro, 9,00 \u20ac de 16 de novembro a 7 de dezembro e 12,00 \u20ac de 8 a 20 de dezembro.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"S\u00e3o Silvestre Jobra\/Vila da Branca 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-26\", \"endDate\": \"2026-12-26\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Est\u00e1dio Municipal da Branca, Vila da Branca, Albergaria-a-Velha\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Albergaria-a-Velha\", \"addressRegion\": \"Aveiro\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"A S\u00e3o Silvestre da Branca 2026 realiza-se a 26 de dezembro em Albergaria-a-Velha, com prova de 10 km e corridas jovens. Consulta hor\u00e1rios e garante a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/cartaz-sao-silvestre-jobra-vila-da-branca-2.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Corrida 10 km (Dist\u00e2ncia Certificada)\", \"price\": \"7.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/lap2go.com\/pt\/event\/sao-silvestre-da-branca-2026\", \"validFrom\": \"2